    "chunk_size_bytes": 1724,
    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nPERSONAL DATA PROTECTION (AMENDMENT)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKATO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\n[Bill No. 8]\n\nPresented by the Minister of Digital Economy on 08th of May, 2025\n\n(Published in the Gazette on March 27, 2025)Ordered by Parliament to be printed\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause amends section 1 of the Personal Data Protection Act, No.9 of 2022 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect of the section as amended is to provide for -\n\n(a) all other provisions of the principal enactment except section 1 to come into operation on such date or dates as the Minister may appoint by Order published in the Gazette; and\n\n(b) anything duly done under Parts V, VI, VIII, IX and X of the principal enactment which have already been brought into operation by Orders made under the repealed subsection (3) of section 1 of the principal enactment, to be valid and continue to be in force.\n\nClause 3 : This clause amends section 12 of the principal enactment by the repeal of subsection (2) of that section and is consequential to the amendment made by clause 11.\n\nClause 4 : This clause amends section 17 of the principal enactment and the legal effect of this section as amended is to provide for-\n\n(a) the procedure to be followed in relation to a request received by a controller from a data subject under section 13, 14, 15, 16 or 18 of the principal enactment; and\n\n(b) such request to be complied with by the controller free of charge, except in certain circumstances."
