    "chunk_text": "1Provincial Councils Elections (Amendment)THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATIC\n\nSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF\n\nSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of May 16, 2025\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 22.05.2025)\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00 Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nPROVINCIAL COUNCILS ELECTIONS\n\n(AMENDMENT)\n\n(Private Members\u2019 Bill)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto amend the Provincial Councils Elections Act, No. 2 of 1988\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. Shanakiyan Rajaputhiran Rasamanickam, M.P. for Batticaloa District\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nProvincial Councils Elections (Amendment)2\n\n1Provincial Councils Elections (Amendment)\n\n2 - PL 15242 - 285 (05/2025)\n\nShort title\n\nAmendment of Act, No. 2 of 1988\n\nSinhala text to prevail in case of inconsistency\n\nAn Act to amend the Provincial Councils Elections\n\nAct, No. 2 of 1988\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows: -\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Provincial Councils Elections (Amendment) Act, No. of 2025.\n\n2. The Provisions of the Provincial Councils Elections Act, No. 2 of 1988 in force on September 21, 2017 shall, notwithstanding the amendments made thereto by Act, No. 17 of 2017, become operative, with effect from the date of coming into force of this Act, without prejudice to any act done during the period commencing from September 22, 2017 to the date of coming into force of this Act, insofar as such act is not inconsistent with the provisions of Act, No. 2 of 1988\n\n3. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhala and Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\nProvincial Councils Elections (Amendment)2\n\nDEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING"
