    "chunk_size_bytes": 1583,
    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA\n\nPart II of May 23, 2025\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 26.05.2025)\n\nPrice : Rs. 18.00 Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nNATIONAL PHOTOGRAPHIC ART SOCIETY OF SRI LANKA (INCORPORATION)\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\n(Private Members\u2019 Bill)\n\nto incorporate the National Photographic Art Society of Sri Lanka\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. Waruna Liyanage, M.P. for Ratnapura District\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nNational Photographic Art Society of Sri Lanka (Incorporation)\n\n1\n\n5\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n2 - PL 15204 - 285 (04/2025)\n\n10\n\nAn Act to incorporate the National Photographic Art Society of Sri Lanka\n\nWHEREAS a Society called and known as the \u201cThe National Photographic Art Society of Sri Lanka\u201d has heretofore been formed in Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectually carrying out its objects and transacting all matters connected with the said foundation according to the rules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Society has heretofore successfully carried out and transacted the several objects and matters for which it was established, and has applied to be incorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grant the said application:\n\nBE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the National Photographic Art Society of Sri Lanka (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2025."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_bills",
    "doc_id": "2025-05-26-2025-05-26-593-2025-en",
