    "chunk_text": "1Budgetary Relief Allowance of Workers (Amendment)\n\nBUDGETARY RELIEF ALLOWANCE OF WORKERS\n\n(AMENDMENT)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto amend the Budgetary Relief Allowance of Workers\n\nAct, No. 4 of 2016\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Minister of Labour on 03rd of June, 2025\n\n(Published in the Gazette on May 20, 2025)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATIC\n\nSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF\n\nSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nprinted at the department of government printing, sri lanka\n\nto be purchased at the government publications bureau, colombo 5Price : Rs. 6.00 Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n[Bill No. 14]\n\nBudgetary Relief Allowance of Workers (Amendment)2\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2: This clause amends section 3 of the Budgetary Relief Allowance of Workers Act, No. 4 of 2016 and the legal effect of that section as amended is to cease the payment of Budgetary Relief Allowance effective from March 31, 2025.\n\nBudgetary Relief Allowance of Workers (Amendment)\n\nL.D.-O 19/2025\n\nAn Act to amend the Budgetary Relief Allowance of\n\nWorkers Act, No. 4 of 2016\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows: -\n\n1. (1) This Act may be cited as the Budgetary Relief Allowance of Workers (Amendment) Act, No. of 2025.\n\n(2) The provisions of this Act shall be deemed to have come into operation on April 1, 2025.\n\n2. Section 3 of the Budgetary Relief Allowance of Workers Act, No. 4 of 2016 is hereby amended as follows: -\n\n(1) in subsection (1) thereof, by the substitution for\n\nthe words and figures \"With effect from May 1, 2015,\", of the words and figures \"For the period commencing on May 1, 2015 and ending on March 31, 2025, ''; and\n\n(2) in subsection (2) thereof, by the substitution\n\nfor the words \"commencing from January 1, 2016\", of the words \"for the period commencing on January 1, 2016 and ending on March 31, 2025,\"."
