    "chunk_text": "CHITHTHA ADVANCED PSYCHOLOGICAL STUDIES OPEN INSTITUTE OF SRI LANKA (INCORPORATION)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto incorporate the Chiththa Advanced Psychological Studies Open Institute of Sri Lanka\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. Hesha Withanage Ankumbura Arachchi,M.P. for Rathnapura District on 06th of June, 2025\n\n(Published in the Gazette on May 29, 2025)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 18]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5Price : Rs. 60.00 Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nChiththa Advanced Psychological Studies Open Institute of Sri Lanka (Incorporation)\n\n1\n\n5\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n2 - PL 15308 - 230 (06/2025)\n\n10\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE CHITHTHA ADVANCED PSYCHOLOGICAL STUDIES OPEN INSTITUTE OF SRI LANKA WHEREAS an Institute called and known as the \u201cChiththa Advanced psychological Studies Open Institute of Sri Lanka\u201d has heretofore been formed in Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectually carrying out its objects and transacting all matters connected with the said Institute according to the rules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Institute has heretofore successfully carried out and transacted the several objects and matters for which it was established, and has applied to be incorporated and it will be expedient to grant the said application:\n\nBE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Chiththa Advanced Psychological Studies Open Institute of Sri Lanka (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2025."
