    "chunk_text": "Provided that nothing herein shall prevent the payment, in good faith, of reasonable and proper remuneration, in return for any services actually rendered to the body corporate by its any of\ufb01 cial or servant other than the members of its\n\n5\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n10\n\nBody corporate may hold property movable and immovable\n\nApplication of moneys and property\n\nTredzo Development Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n15\n\nFurther provided that the aforesaid provision shall not apply for any payment to any company which is a member of the Executive Committee or Governing Body and whom do not hold more than one hundredth part of the capital and do not bound to account for any share of pro\ufb01 ts that company may receive in respect of such payment.\n\n15. The Seal of the body corporate shall not be af\ufb01 xed to any instrument except in the presence of, two members of the Committee, one Member of the Committee and the Secretary or a person appointed for the purpose under the authority or resolution of the Committee, and that member of the Committee, the Secretary or other person as aforesaid shall sign every instrument to which the Seal of the body corporate is so af\ufb01 xed in their presence.\n\n16. (1) If upon the winding up or dissolution of the body corporate there remains after the satisfaction of all its debts and liabilities, any property whatsoever, the same shall not be paid to or distributed among the members of the body corporate but shall be given or transferred to any other organization having objects similar to the objects of the body corporate and which is by the rules thereof, prohibited from distributing any income or property among its members.\n\n5\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n10\n\nSeal of the body corporate\n\nProperty remaining on dissolution\n\n16Tredzo Development Foundation (Incorporation)"
