    "chunk_text": "COLOMBO ASSOCIATION OF LANGUAGE SKILLS\n\nAND DRAMATIC ART (INCORPORATION)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto incorporate the Colombo Association of\n\nLanguage Skills and Dramatic Art\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. Shanakiyan Rajaputhiran Rasamanickam, M.P. for\n\nBatticaloa District on 18th of June, 2025\n\n(Published in the Gazette on June 02, 2025)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATIC\n\nSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF\n\nSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nprinted at the department of government printing, sri lanka\n\nto be purchased at the government publications bureau, colombo 5Price : Rs. 58.00 Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n[Bill No. 24]\n\n3Colombo Association of Language Skills and\n\nDramatic Art (Incorporation)\n\nAn Act to incorporate the Colombo Association of\n\nLanguage Skills and Dramatic Art\n\nWHEREAS an Association called and known as the \u201cColombo Association of Language Skills and Dramatic Art\u201d has heretofore been established in Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectually carrying out its objects and transacting all matters connected with the said Association according to the rules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Association has heretofore successfully carried out and transacted the several objects and matters for which it was established and has applied to be incorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grant the said application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows: -\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Colombo Association of Language Skills and Dramatic Art (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2025."
  },
