    "chunk_text": "(h) to work for the advancement of various local cultures; and\n\nThe General objects of the body corporate\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nBody corporate operates as a not-for-profit Organization\n\n3Kodhagoda Gunarathana Nahimi Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n(2) In the implementation of the objects specified in subsection (1) the Corporation shall ensure that such implementation shall be carried out without any discrimination based on race, religion, language, caste, sex, political opinion, place of birth or any of such grounds.\n\n5. The objects of the body corporate shall be carried out in such manner so as not to create any conflict between the work of the Corporation and any work being carried out simultaneously by any Ministry or Department of the Government or any Provincial Council.\n\n6. (1) Subject to the provisions of this Act the body corporate shall be carried out by a Board of Management (hereinafter referred to as \u201cthe Board\u201d consisting of such number of office bearers as may be specified by the rules made under section 8.\n\n(2) (a) The Board of Management of the foundation that holds office on the day immediately preceding the date of commencement of this Act, shall function as the Board of the body corporate until the first Board is appointed or elected in the manner provided for by rules made under section 8.\n\n(b) The first Board of the body corporate shall be appointed or elected within one year of the date of commencement of this Act.\n\n(3) (a) Every office bearer of the Board including the patrons and advisors, shall be appointed or elected for a period of three years and any such office bearer, patron or advisor shall be eligible for re-appointment or re-election after lapse of the said period of three years.\n\nBody corporateto ensure no conflict with work ofMinistry orDepartment ofthe CentralGovernment or Province\n\nManagement of the Affairs of the bodycorporate\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\nKodhagoda Gunarathana Nahimi Foundation (Incorporation)4"
