    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA\n\nPart II of July 04, 2025\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 04.07.2025)\n\nLAND DEVELOPMENT (AMENDMENT)\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. (Mrs.) Rohini Kumari Wijerathna, M. P. for Matale District\n\nto amend the Land Development Ordinance (Chapter 464)\n\nPrice : Rs. 14.50 Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nA\n\n(Private Members\u2019 Bill)\n\n1Land Development (Amendment)\n\nShort title\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE LAND DEVELOPMENT ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 464)\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Land Development (Amendment) Act, No. of 2025.\n\n2. Section 48A of the principal enactment is hereby amended by the repeal of the words \u201cor upon his or her marriage\u201d in subsection 48A 2(c).\n\n3. Section 48B of the principal enactment is hereby amended by the repeal of subsection 48B 1(a).\n\n4. Section 68 of the principal enactment is hereby amended in subsection (1) of that section by the substitution for the words \u201cfails to succeed\u201d of the words \u201cfails without reasonable cause to succeed\u201d.\n\n5. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhala and Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nAmendment to section 48A of the principal enactment\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\nSinhala text to prevail in case of inconsistency\n\nAmendment to section 68 of the principal enactment\n\nAmendment to section 48B of the principal enactment\n\n2Land Development (Amendment)\n\nDEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING"
