    "chunk_size_bytes": 2036,
    "chunk_text": "1Penal Code (Amendment)THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA\n\nPart II of July 04, 2025\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 08.07.2025)\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 29.00 Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nPENAL CODE (AMENDMENT)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto amend the Penal Code (Chapter19)\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Justice and National Integration\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nPenal Code (Amendment)2\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause amends section 82 of the Penal Code (Chapter 19) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect of the amendment is to exclude the amendment proposed to be made by clause 4 from the scope of the general exceptions.\n\nClause 3 : This clause amends section 308a of the principal enactment by substituting the word \u201cwilfully\u201d with the word \u201cintentionally\u201d.\n\nClause 4 : This clause inserts new section 308b in the principal enactment and the legal effect of the amendment is to prohibit the imposing of cruel and degrading physical or nonphysical punishments on children.\n\nClause 5 : This clause inserts new section 314a in the principal enactment and the legal effect of the amendment is to introduce an enhanced penalty where the offence of voluntarily causing hurt is committed against a child.\n\nClause 6 : This clause inserts new section 316a in the principal enactment and the legal effect of the amendment is to introduce an enhanced penalty where the offence of voluntarily causing grievous hurt is committed against a child.\n\nClause 7 : This clause amends section 341 of the principal enactment and is consequential to the amendment made by clause 4.\n\n1Penal Code (Amendment)\n\nShort title\n\nAmendment of section 308a of the principal enactment\n\nInsertion of new section 308b in the principal enactment\n\nAmendment of section 82 of Chapter 19\n\n\u201cCorporal punishment in respect of children"
