    "md5": "4e0003ea9dcca08dd1c0f9cff7fa836d",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1940,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Kodhagoda Gunarathana Nahimi Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2025.\n\n(2) The body corporate shall be deemed to be a voluntary social service organization within the meaning, and for the purpose of the Voluntary Social Service Organizations (Registration and Supervision) Act, No. 31 of 1980 and the\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\nPreamble\n\nKodhagoda Gunarathana Nahimi Foundation (Incorporation)2\n\nprovisions of that Act shall apply to and in relation to the management of the affairs of the Corporation.\n\n3. The body corporate shall operates exclusively as a not for profit Organization and it is solely for the benefit of the society and its members.\n\n4. (1) The general objects for which the body corporate is constituted are hereby declared to be:-\n\n(a) to develop quality relationship between members and beneficiaries of the Kodhagoda Gunaratana Nahimi Foundation;\n\n(b) to develop human resources and facilite career development;\n\n(c) to create a religious and cultural revival of the members and beneficiaries of the Foundation;\n\n(d) to establish appropriate liaison between Kodhagoda Gunarathana Nahimi Foundation and national and international organizations, thereby promoting moral and physical development of Kodagoda Gunarathana Nahimi Foundation;\n\n(e) to bring the religious, moral, educational and physical development to the various ethnicities of Sri Lanka;\n\n(f) to develop quality relationship between members of the Foundation and it\u2019s beneficiaries;\n\n(g) to facilitate the economic and professional development of the low income community;\n\n(h) to work for the advancement of various local cultures; and\n\nThe General objects of the body corporate\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nBody corporate operates as a not-for-profit Organization\n\n3Kodhagoda Gunarathana Nahimi Foundation (Incorporation)"
