    "chunk_text": "1Protection of OccupantsTHE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of September 12, 2025\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 18.09.2025)\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 45.00Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nPROTECTION OF OCCUPANTS\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto prevent a landlord from ejecting persons from occupation of a premises; and to provide for matters connected therewith or incidental thereto\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Justice and National Integration\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1Protection of Occupants\n\nApplication of the Act\n\nLandlord notto discontinue amenities or facilities\n\nL.D. \u2013 O. 64/2023An Act to prevent a landlord from ejecting personsfrom occupation of a premises; and to provide for matters connected therewith or incidental thereto\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows: -\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Protection of OccupantsAct, No. of 2025.\n\n2. The provisions of this Act shall apply to a person who-\n\n(a) is in lawful occupation of a premises; and\n\n(b) has been in undisturbed and uninterruptedoccupation of such premises for a period of morethan three months, prior to the eventualitiesspecified under section 3, 4 or 5,\n\nin this Act referred to as the \u201coccupant\u201d.\n\nPART I\n\nSafeguards afforded to Occupants\n\n3. The landlord of any premises, either by himself orthrough any other person, shall not-\n\n(a) discontinue or withhold any amenity or facility orany essential supply or utility service previouslyprovided to the occupant; or\n\n(b) refuse, withhold, fail to repair or maintain inproper condition, or refuse to grant permissionto repair or maintain in proper condition, anyessential supply or utility service previouslyprovided to the occupant.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nShort title\n\nProtection of Occupants2"
