    "chunk_text": "01Sri Lanka Institute of Architects (Amendment)THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATIC\n\nSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA\n\nPart II of September 19, 2025\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 22.09.2025)\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 29.00 Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nSRI LANKA INSTITUTE OF ARCHITECTS (AMENDMENT)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto amend the Sri Lanka Institute of Architects Law, No. 1 of 1976\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Urban Development, Construction and Housing\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nSri Lanka Institute of Architects (Amendment)02\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2: This clause amends the section 7 of the Sri Lanka Institute of Architects Law, No.1 of 1976 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect of that section as amended is to provide for those who have been enrolled as Associates to the Institute on the day immediately preceding the date of coming into operation of this Act, to be considered as members of the Institute.\n\nClause 3: This clause amends section 12 of the principal enactment and is consequential to the amendment made by the clause 2.\n\nClause 4: This clause is consequential to the amendment made by the clause 2.\n\n1Sri Lanka Institute of Architects (Amendment)\n\nShort title\n\nAmendment of section 7 of Law, No. 1 of 1976\n\nAmendment of section 12 of the principal enactment.\n\nL. D. - O 33/2023\n\nAn Act to amend the Sri Lanka Institute of\n\nArchitects Law, No. 1 of 1976\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Sri Lanka Institute of Architects (Amendment) Act, No. of 2025."
