    "chunk_text": "01Social Security Contribution Levy (Amendment)THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA\n\nPart II of September 26, 2025\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 01.10.2025)\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 29.00 Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nSOCIAL SECURITY CONTRIBUTION LEVY (AMENDMENT)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto amend the Social Security Contribution Levy Act, No. 25 of 2022\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Finance, Planning and Economic Development\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nSocial Security Contribution Levy (Amendment)02\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2: This clause amends the First Schedule to the Social Security Contribution Levy Act, No. 25 of 2022, and the legal effect of that schedule as amended is to -\n\n(a) restrict the exemption provided under item 24 of PART IA by setting out a time period applicable to any institution referred to in such item;\n\n(b) make the exemption provided under item 4 of PART IB clearer to include the wholesale and retail sale of such exempted articles;\n\n(c) expand the exemption provided under item 4 of PART II by applying the exemption to services provided in relation to international transportation by container terminal operators; and\n\n(d) exempt the financial services under PART II.\n\n1Social Security Contribution Levy (Amendment)\n\nL.D. -O 12/2025\n\nAn Act to amend the Social Security Contribution Levy Act, No. 25 of 2022\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows: -\n\n1. (1) This Act may be cited as the Social Security Contribution Levy (Amendment) Act, No. of 2025.\n\n(2) The provisions of this Act, other than the provisions of subsections (1), (2) and (3) of section 2, shall come into operation on the date on which the Bill becomes an Act of Parliament."
